{"id": "C01", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["cystic"], "keywords": ["cystic"], "priority": 1, "source_ids": ["S01", "S04"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6199172/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02 / CE1–CE3形态", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S04": "indexed full-text section excerpts only"}, "text": "若见子囊或囊内分离膜样结构，可把它们作为囊型包虫病的支持线索，并检查结构是否真实连续。单纯液性外观仍可能与其他囊肿重叠。", "limitations": "单张静态图不能证实膜漂浮、虫体活动或病原学诊断。"}
{"id": "C02", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["cystic"], "keywords": ["cystic"], "priority": 2, "source_ids": ["S01", "S07"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13244-022-01242-3"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K03/K05 / CL与单纯囊肿", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S07": "full relevant web sections"}, "text": "薄壁、均匀液性和后方增强可见于单纯囊肿；早期囊型包虫病也可能呈单囊外观。若双层壁或子囊不清，保留不确定性。", "limitations": "CL是不确定的囊性病变描述，不能直接当作阴性；未显示典型结构不是排除依据。"}
{"id": "C03", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["cystic"], "keywords": ["cystic"], "priority": 3, "source_ids": ["S06", "S07"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/", "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13244-022-01242-3"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K05 / 复杂囊性病变", "reading_scope": {"S06": "local PDF relevant sections", "S07": "full relevant web sections"}, "text": "若囊内有分隔、碎屑或实性成分，可对照复杂囊肿、脓肿及囊性肿瘤等重叠形态；只有原图可见线索才应影响判断。", "limitations": "灰阶静态图不能补出发热、感染史或强化方式。"}
{"id": "C04", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["cystic"], "keywords": ["cystic"], "priority": 4, "source_ids": ["S01", "S04"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6199172/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02 / CE2与CE3b", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S04": "indexed full-text section excerpts only"}, "text": "多子囊的排列及其与周围基质的关系可能提供线索；观察液性小腔是否有共同母囊及可辨边界，避免把普通间隔误认子囊。", "limitations": "这些线索不单独确定病因或分期；本任务不要求输出CE分期。"}
{"id": "C05", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["mixed_solid"], "keywords": ["mixed_solid"], "priority": 1, "source_ids": ["S01", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02/K05 / CE退变与实性重叠", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "囊型包虫病退变时可呈混合或偏实性、不均匀内部结构；若见折叠膜样线索可参考，同时考虑其他复杂囊肿或实性病变。", "limitations": "偏实性不等于非包虫病；没有典型膜样结构也不能强行补出。"}
{"id": "C06", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["mixed_solid"], "keywords": ["mixed_solid"], "priority": 2, "source_ids": ["S05", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.wjgnet.com/1007-9327/full/v21/i43/12392.htm", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K04 / AE形态模式与鉴别", "reading_scope": {"S05": "local PDF and publisher relevant sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "泡型包虫病可表现为不规则异质病变，伴小囊性区或钙化等组合；可与其他肝脏病变相似，应核对原图边界与内部结构。", "limitations": "不要求出现典型液性母囊；不规则或异质本身并不特异。"}
{"id": "C07", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["mixed_solid"], "keywords": ["mixed_solid"], "priority": 3, "source_ids": ["S05", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.wjgnet.com/1007-9327/full/v21/i43/12392.htm", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K04/K05 / 实性鉴别", "reading_scope": {"S05": "local PDF and publisher relevant sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "强回声、异质实性或假囊性外观可有多种病因。比较可见结构组合比仅给出血管瘤、转移瘤等名称更有依据。", "limitations": "静态灰阶图不能据此推定血流、增强表现或肿瘤病史。"}
{"id": "C08", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["calcified"], "keywords": ["calcified"], "priority": 1, "source_ids": ["S01", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02/K06 / 钙化与声影", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "若见强回声边缘和后方声影，考虑钙化可能及其遮挡范围。包虫病中可有钙化，但其他病变也可能钙化。", "limitations": "钙化并非某一CE分期专属，也不能单凭钙化判断病灶活性或患病与否。"}
{"id": "C09", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["calcified"], "keywords": ["calcified"], "priority": 2, "source_ids": ["S05", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.wjgnet.com/1007-9327/full/v21/i43/12392.htm", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K04 / AE钙化模式", "reading_scope": {"S05": "local PDF and publisher relevant sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "散在点状或较大片强回声伴声影，可与泡型包虫病的其他形态共同考虑；先判断可见边界和未被遮挡的部分。", "limitations": "强回声不必然是钙化；遮挡后的结构属于未知，不能补成正常或子囊。"}
{"id": "C10", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["calcified"], "keywords": ["calcified"], "priority": 3, "source_ids": ["S01", "S09"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5361546/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02/K01 / 分期可靠性", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S09": "downloaded full PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "退变或钙化病灶仍可能属于包虫病；本研究标签关注疾病本身。将可判读范围与不能分辨的内部结构分别描述。", "limitations": "不把“可能不活跃”解释为“无包虫病”；单幅图不足以保证分期可靠。"}
{"id": "C11", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["no_focal_lesion"], "keywords": ["no_focal_lesion"], "priority": 1, "source_ids": ["S06", "S09"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5361546/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K01/K07 / 视野与可判读范围；项目推论", "reading_scope": {"S06": "local PDF relevant sections", "S09": "downloaded full PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "若本切面未见明确局灶异常，可依据可见肝实质给出估计，并描述视野、遮挡或分辨率限制。", "limitations": "局部切面未见病灶不等于完整检查已排除疾病；这也是单图研究的适用边界。"}
{"id": "C12", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["no_focal_lesion"], "keywords": ["no_focal_lesion"], "priority": 2, "source_ids": ["S09", "S11"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5361546/", "https://journals.plos.org/plosntds/article?id=10.1371/journal.pntd.0001444"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K01 / 图像质量与观察者限制；项目推论", "reading_scope": {"S09": "downloaded full PDF relevant sections", "S11": "full relevant web sections"}, "text": "观察是否有足够可用的肝脏区域，避免只依靠仪器文字或来源风格判断。质量有限时应指出具体可见限制。", "limitations": "仅在无法形成有依据的概率估计时拒答，不把图像质量差直接解释为阴性。"}
{"id": "C13", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["general"], "keywords": ["general"], "priority": 1, "source_ids": ["S01", "S05", "S06"], "source_urls": ["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK616291/", "https://www.wjgnet.com/1007-9327/full/v21/i43/12392.htm", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K02/K04 / CE与AE形态多样性", "reading_scope": {"S01": "full relevant web sections", "S05": "local PDF and publisher relevant sections", "S06": "local PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "肝包虫病包括囊型与泡型，外观可能为囊性、混合、偏实性或钙化。以当前原图可见的结构组合判断，不要求所有典型征象同时出现。", "limitations": "任何一种宽泛形态都不是诊断真值；仍应考虑可见的重叠解释。"}
{"id": "C14", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["general"], "keywords": ["general"], "priority": 2, "source_ids": ["S06", "S09"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/", "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5361546/"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K01/K06 / 静态超声边界；项目推论", "reading_scope": {"S06": "local PDF relevant sections", "S09": "downloaded full PDF relevant sections"}, "text": "只使用灰阶静态图确实显示的结构，区分未显示与明确不存在；如信息不足，描述原因并保留不确定性。", "limitations": "不能推测动态征象、血流、增强、CT/MRI、病史或病理。"}
{"id": "C15", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["general"], "keywords": ["general"], "priority": 3, "source_ids": ["S09", "S11"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5361546/", "https://journals.plos.org/plosntds/article?id=10.1371/journal.pntd.0001444"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K07 / 模型概率协议；项目推论", "reading_scope": {"S09": "downloaded full PDF relevant sections", "S11": "full relevant web sections"}, "text": "参考图标签只描述参考病例；它们的类别比例不代表查询人群患病率。可见形态相似可供参考，但不是同一病因的证明。", "limitations": "模型给出的概率尚未校准，不能视为经过验证的个体临床风险。"}
{"id": "C16", "modality": "ultrasound", "branches": ["mixed_solid", "cystic"], "keywords": ["mixed_solid", "cystic"], "priority": 4, "source_ids": ["S06", "S07"], "source_urls": ["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11514533/", "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13244-022-01242-3"], "locator": "prompts/he_medical.txt K05/K07 / 多病灶观察；项目推论", "reading_scope": {"S06": "local PDF relevant sections", "S07": "full relevant web sections"}, "text": "存在多个可见病灶时，可分别观察其形态，再估计当前图像相关的患病概率；相邻结构可能属于不同病灶。", "limitations": "不要把多个病灶各自的片段合成一套原图不存在的典型征象。"}
